'''''The Morning of the Streltsy Execution''''' is a painting by [[Vasily Surikov|Vasily Ivanovich Surikov]], painted in 1881. It illustrates the public execution after the [[Streltsy uprising|Streltsy's failed attempted uprising]] of 1698 before the walls of the [[Kremlin]].<ref name=tret>[https://my.tretyakov.ru/app/masterpiece/8414 Суриков Василий (1848-1916) Утро стрелецкой казни 1881] </ref>

The painting can be found at the [[Tretyakov Gallery]] in Moscow.<ref name=tret/>

